<div>
	<div class="modal-header">
		<button type="button" class="close" ng-click="dismiss()">&times;</button>
		<h4 class="modal-title">Uninstall Language</h4>
	</div>
	<div class="modal-body">
		<p>
			Are you sure you want to uninstall this language?
		</p>
		<div style="background: #f2dede; padding: 9px; margin-top: 15px;">
			<p>
				<span class="text-danger">Please note that there may be data loss as a result of removing this language:</span>
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Snippets written in this language will be removed.</li>
				<li>Tickets using this lanugage will be reverted back to using the default language.</li>
				<li>Users will no longer be able to select this language from the portal.</li>
				<li>Existing users using this language will be reverted back to using the default language.</li>
				<li>Translations (including department translations, translated field titles, and custom phrases).</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				If you later re-install this language, the records mentioned above will <strong>not</strong> be restored.
				You will need to manually re-save those records (e.g., manually re-create snippets, manually re-set ticket language etc.).
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="modal-footer">
		<button class="btn btn-success" ng-click="dismiss()"><i class="fa fa-undo"></i> {{ phrase('agent.general.cancel') }}</button>
		<button class="btn btn-danger" ng-click="confirm()"><i class="fa fa-trash-o"></i> Uninstall</button>
	</div>
</div>
